# A finite idealized circuit instance. No empirical guarantees about real wiring.
axioms 1 ideal_circuit 1.0
fact battery.charged | Model assumption: the ideal battery is charged.
fact switch.closed | Model assumption: the ideal switch is closed.
fact wire.intact | Model assumption: the ideal wire is intact.
rule loop.ready -> lamp.on | Ideal circuit definition: a ready loop lights the lamp.
rule battery.charged & switch.closed & wire.intact -> loop.ready | Ideal series-circuit assumption.
rule lamp.on -> sensor.bright | Model assumption: the ideal sensor detects the lamp.
